+**Subagent results during a running turn.** A background subagent's result
+that arrives while its session's turn is still running waits behind that
+turn, so the agent learns of it only after it ends the turn. Set
+`sessions.mid_turn_subagent_results: true` to hand it to the running turn
+instead:
+
+```yaml
+sessions:
+  mid_turn_subagent_results: true
+```
+
+The result, in the same `[ASYNC DELEGATION ... COMPLETE ...]` form, rides the
+turn's next tool result, so the agent can act on it before it finishes. No
+running tool is interrupted for it. When the turn makes no further tool call,
+or is stopped first, the result goes back to its place in the queue and runs
+or is noted after the turn as before. Only a result dispatched from the same
+conversation is handed over; an idle session is unchanged.
+
 ### Oversized-Transcript Guards
 
 Two limits stop a runaway transcript from being loaded into memory all at once
